
@endpoint = http://localhost:3000/Api/V1/Purchases

###

### creating a purchase
# @name postApurchase
POST {{endpoint}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"id":"1",
"type":"Food",
"amount":14.95,
"date":"2026-01-06"
}

### getting a purchase (the last one)
@newPurchase = {{postApurchase.response.body._id}}
GET {{endpoint}}/{{{{newPurchase}}}} Http/3.0

